; DNS for AI Discovery (DNS-AID) records for hajimekyokushin.com
; Spec: draft-mozleywilliams-dnsop-dnsaid  +  RFC 9460 (SVCB/HTTPS)
;
; These are ServiceMode SVCB records (priority != 0) published under the
; _agents underscore namespace. They advertise where AI agents can discover
; this organization's public agent surface.
;
; hajimekyokushin.com is a static site that already serves agent-readable
; Markdown via content negotiation (see ../src/worker.js). It does NOT run an
; A2A or MCP agent server, so only the organizational *index* entrypoint is
; published here. The TargetName points validating agents at the website over
; HTTPS (h2/h3, port 443). Add an _a2a / _mcp record ONLY if a real endpoint
; for that protocol exists.
;
; TTL 3600 (1h). TargetName has no underscores, per the draft, because public
; x.509 certificates are used in communications with the index.

_index._agents.hajimekyokushin.com. 3600 IN SVCB 1 hajimekyokushin.com. alpn="h2,h3" port=443

; --- OPTIONAL, publish only if the endpoint actually exists ---
; _a2a._agents.hajimekyokushin.com.  3600 IN SVCB 1 agent.hajimekyokushin.com. alpn="a2a" port=443
; _mcp._agents.hajimekyokushin.com.  3600 IN SVCB 1 agent.hajimekyokushin.com. alpn="mcp" port=443
